«
@@ ============================================================
@@ P♂DayAtm — Mars dayside (Viking) pressure, Braeunig Tables 13/15 (-8..300 km)
@@ Author & design         : Jean Wilson
@@ Co-authors & programming : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
@@
@@ Input  : Z   ( geometric altitude, length unit e.g. 50_km )
@@ Output : see units below
@@ VALIDATION (device / double-precision):
@@   0_m -> 610.5 Pa ; 50_km -> 3.28196 Pa ; 100_km -> 0.00502742 Pa
@@ ============================================================
@Mars Day (Viking) pressure  P♂DayAtm(Z); Z geometric altitude
@Source: R. Braeunig, "Atmospheric Modeling", Tables 11-15 — https://www.braeunig.us/space/atmmodel.htm#mars
@0-120 km Table 13 dayside (geopotential h); 120-300 km Table 15
@Validity: -8_km ≤ Z ≤ 300_km
  → Z
  «
    Z 1_m Convert 'Z' Store
    Z UnitValue 1000 ÷
    → z
    «
      z 120 ≥ z 300 ≤ And
      if then
        z 200 <
        if then
          -4.18520E-10 z × 3.45846E-07 + z × -1.13352E-04 + z × 0.0188613 + z × -1.71718 + z × 61.10381 + exp
        else
          -4.83452E-11 z × 6.96178E-08 + z × -4.03197E-05 + z × 0.0117655 + z × -1.76494 + z × 93.67154 + exp
        end
      else
        z 300 >
        if then "Z out of range -8_km < Z < 300_km" DoError
        else
          z 3389.51 × 3389.51 z + ÷
          → h
          «
            case
              h 39  < then h -1.80 × 228.50 + 228.50 Swap ÷ 19.435 -1.80 ÷ ^ 610.5     × end
              h 48  < then h 39 - -19.435 × 158.30 ÷ exp 11.6025                        × end
              h 55  < then h 48 - -2.35 × 158.30 + 158.30 Swap ÷ 19.435 -2.35 ÷ ^ 3.84305  × end
              h 66  < then h 55 -  0.65 × 141.85 + 141.85 Swap ÷ 19.435  0.65 ÷ ^ 1.55091  × end
              h 75  < then h 66 - -2.50 × 149.00 + 149.00 Swap ÷ 19.435 -2.50 ÷ ^ 0.356464 × end
              h 84  < then h 75 -  2.50 × 126.50 + 126.50 Swap ÷ 19.435  2.50 ÷ ^ 0.0998430 × end
              h 95  < then h 84 - -19.435 × 149.00 ÷ exp 0.0279653                      × end
              h 105 < then h 95 - -1.40 × 149.00 + 149.00 Swap ÷ 19.435 -1.40 ÷ ^ 0.00666032 × end
                           h 105 - -0.65 × 135.00 + 135.00 Swap ÷ 19.435 -0.65 ÷ ^ 0.00169282 ×
            end
          »
        end
      end
      1_Pa ×
    »
  »
»
